<doc>
Generic RouterOS "key: value" print output, one {"key", "value"} entry per line. Keys keep RouterOS
names (e.g. "board-name") so new or reformatted lines between RouterOS releases do not break parsing.
</doc>

<group name="system*">
{{ key | re("[ \t]*[a-z0-9-]+") | strip }}: {{ value | re(".*") | strip }}
</group>
